  "description": "Ten years ago, Seulha was the popular campus \"It Girl\" and Doseok was the college loser-- until she accidentally ruined his life. Today, their roles are completely inverted: Seulha is an exhausted workplace loner, and Doseok has returned as her gorgeous, unstoppable team leader. Doseok is back with one goal: to complete some unfinished business. Can Seulha survive his cold authority, or will her past finally catch up to her?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=852164), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14333883) \n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[English (Censored)](https://www.webtoons.com/en/romance/i-am-your-revenge/list?title_no=11607), [French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/romance/i-am-your-revenge/list?title_no=11297)",
